{"id":102,"name":"exeggcute","speciesId":102,"dex":102,"form":"normal","generation":1,"types":["grass","psychic"],"stats":{"hp":60,"attack":40,"defense":80,"special-attack":60,"special-defense":45,"speed":40},"abilities":[{"name":"chlorophyll","hidden":false},{"name":"harvest","hidden":true}],"height":4,"weight":25,"baseExp":65,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/102.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/102.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/102.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/102.ogg","genus":"Egg Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"red","text":"Often mistaken for eggs. When disturbed, they quickly gather and attack in swarms."},{"version":"yellow","text":"The heads attract each other and spin around. There must be 6 heads for it to maintain balance."},{"version":"gold","text":"The shell is very durable. Even if it cracks, it can survive without spilling the contents."},{"version":"silver","text":"Using telepathy only they can receive, they always form a cluster of six EXEGGCUTE."},{"version":"crystal","text":"If even one is separated from the group, the energy bond between the six will make them rejoin instantly."},{"version":"ruby","text":"This POKéMON consists of six eggs that form a closely knit cluster. The six eggs attract each other and spin around. When cracks increasingly appear on the eggs, EXEGGCUTE is close to evolution."},{"version":"emerald","text":"It consists of six eggs that care for each other. The eggs attract each other and spin around. When cracks increasingly appear, it is close to evolution."},{"version":"firered","text":"Even though it appears to be eggs of some sort, it was discovered to be a life- form more like plant seeds."},{"version":"leafgreen","text":"It is often mistaken for eggs. When disturbed, they quickly gather and attack in swarms."},{"version":"diamond","text":"Its six eggs converse using telepathy. They can quickly gather if they become separated."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"Their shells are very durable. Even if they crack, they can survive without spilling their contents."},{"version":"soulsilver","text":"Using telepathy only they can employ, they always form a cluster of six EXEGGCUTE."},{"version":"y","text":"Even though it appears to be eggs of some sort, it was discovered to be a life-form more like plant seeds."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"This Pokémon consists of six eggs that form a closely knit cluster. The six eggs attract each other and spin around. When cracks increasingly appear on the eggs, Exeggcute is close to evolution."},{"version":"sun","text":"Its six eggs use telepathy to communicate among themselves. It is believed to carry plant genes and the genes of other species."},{"version":"moon","text":"Six of them together form a full-fledged Pokémon. It’s often hunted by Crabrawler, but uses psychokinesis to drive it off."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"Six of them form a single Pokémon. Should one of the six be lost, the next morning there will once more be six."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Although they are the same size as other Exeggcute, the ones produced in Alola are quite heavy. Their shells are packed full."},{"version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"The heads attract each other and spin around. There must be six heads for it to maintain balance."},{"version":"sword","text":"Though it may look like it’s just a bunch of eggs, it’s a proper Pokémon. Exeggcute communicates with others of its kind via telepathy, apparently."},{"version":"shield","text":"These Pokémon get nervous when they’re not in a group of six. The minute even one member of the group goes missing, Exeggcute become cowardly."}],"genderRate":4,"captureRate":90,"eggGroups":["plant"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution"